{{!
    Student play view for mod_agon. Filled in by amd/src/player.js from
    window.AGON + the mod_agon web services.
}}
<div class="agon agon-page">
  <div class="app" id="agon-app" role="group" aria-label="Agon learning games">
    <div id="agon-live" class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <header class="app__header">
      <div>
        <div class="app__title">Agon</div>
        <div class="app__sub" id="a-sub">{{subject}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="head-side">
        <span class="pill" id="a-week">Week {{week}}</span>
        <label class="switch" title="Show why answers are correct"><input type="checkbox" id="explain-toggle" checked><span class="track" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Explain</span></label>
        <button class="hint-btn" id="hint" type="button" aria-label="Hint (one per attempt)" title="Hint (one per attempt)">&#128161;</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="app__content" id="app-content">
      <section class="stage is-active" id="stage-start" aria-labelledby="t-start">
        <div class="ag-card">
          <div class="kicker">Today's challenge</div>
          <h2 class="stage__title" id="t-start" tabindex="-1">{{subject}}</h2>
          <p class="lead">Three mini-games: crossword, weekly question, and coding. Earn points for the course leaderboard.</p>
          <div class="scorebox">
            <b>Scoring</b><br>
            {{#cwregular}}Crossword: full solve = <b>1.0</b> &middot; partial = fraction of words correct (e.g. 4 of 10 = <b>0.40</b>){{/cwregular}}
            {{^cwregular}}Crossword: full solve, 1st&ndash;3rd = <b>1.0</b>, 4th&ndash;10th = <b>0.75</b>, later = <b>0.5</b> &middot; partial up to <b>0.49</b>{{/cwregular}}<br>
            Question: correct = <b>1.0</b> &middot; Coding: partial credit per blank<br>
            1 hint &middot; 1 attempt
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="stage" id="stage-crossword" aria-labelledby="t-cw">
        <div class="kicker">Game 1 &middot; Recall</div>
        <h2 class="stage__title" id="t-cw" tabindex="-1">Crossword</h2>
        <p class="lead">Fill in the words from the clues. No time limit. (Hint reveals a letter.)</p>
        <div class="ag-card"><div class="cw" id="cw" role="group" aria-label="Crossword grid"></div></div>
        <div class="ag-card clues" id="clues"></div>
        <div class="feedback" id="fb-cw" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
      </section>

      <section class="stage" id="stage-question" aria-labelledby="t-q">
        <div class="kicker">Game 2 &middot; Understand</div>
        <h2 class="stage__title" id="t-q" tabindex="-1">Weekly question</h2>
        <div class="timer" id="timer-q" aria-hidden="true" hidden>&#9201; 0:14</div>
        <div class="ready" id="ready-q">
          <div class="ready__big" aria-hidden="true">&#9201; 14s</div>
          <p>The question is hidden until you're ready. The clock starts when you press <b>Start</b>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ag-card" id="q-host" hidden></div>
        <div class="feedback" id="fb-q" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
      </section>

      <section class="stage" id="stage-coding" aria-labelledby="t-code">
        <div class="kicker">Game 3 &middot; Apply</div>
        <h2 class="stage__title" id="t-code" tabindex="-1">Coding</h2>
        <div class="timer" id="timer-code" aria-hidden="true" hidden>&#9201; 0:14</div>
        <div class="ready" id="ready-code">
          <div class="ready__big" aria-hidden="true">&#9201; 14s</div>
          <p>The code is hidden until you're ready — one sequence at a time. The clock starts when you press <b>Start</b>.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="lead">Only one sequence shows at a time. Use &#9660; to reveal the next line, then the next sequence (earlier ones lock). Choose an option and a blank to place it (drag also works on a mouse); choose a filled blank to clear it. (Hint cues the next blank.)</p>
        <div id="coding" hidden></div>
        <div class="feedback" id="fb-code" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
      </section>

      <section class="stage" id="stage-review" aria-labelledby="t-review">
        <h2 class="stage__title" id="t-review" tabindex="-1">Correct sequence</h2>
        <div class="ag-card"><div id="review-body"></div></div>
      </section>

      <section class="stage" id="stage-results" aria-labelledby="t-results">
        <h2 class="stage__title" id="t-results" tabindex="-1">Today's score</h2>
        <div class="ag-card">
          <div class="score-big" id="score-total">0.00</div>
          <div id="score-rows"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ag-card">
          <div class="kicker">Course leaderboard</div>
          <ol class="lb" id="lb"></ol>
        </div>
        <div class="ag-card" id="testbar" hidden>
          <div class="kicker">Testing</div>
          <button class="ag-btn ag-btn--primary" id="play-again" type="button">&#8635; Play again</button>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="app__footer">
      <nav class="stepper" id="stepper" aria-hidden="true"></nav>
      <button class="ag-btn ag-btn--primary" id="cta" type="button">Start</button>
    </footer>
  </div>
</div>
